{"id": "EUVD-2026-97494", "enisaUuid": "eea073cd-cd1b-3828-9061-0f5c61c580bd", "description": "Thelia before 3.1.2 and 3.2.x before 3.2.1 contains an unrestricted file upload vulnerability that allows authenticated back-office users to upload PHP files by appending a trailing space to filenames. FileProcessorService validates the raw filename but FileManager::sanitizeFileName() strips the space, storing an executable .php file under public/cache/documents/ for code execution as the web server user.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T15:16:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:57:16", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/thelia/thelia/security/advisories/GHSA-5524-qfxp-33v9", "https://github.com/thelia/thelia/commit/6b706f5cb96e6b12d890c6d16edb1c9d1fd8191a", "https://github.com/thelia/thelia/commit/b71258902b5dd278007d0f37ddad45f76d06d5bc", "https://github.com/thelia/thelia/blob/3.2.0/core/lib/Thelia/Core/File/Service/FileProcessorService.php#L119-L160", "https://github.com/thelia/thelia/releases/tag/3.1.2", "https://github.com/thelia/thelia/releases/tag/3.2.1", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/thelia-before-3.1.2-and-3.2-x-before-3.2.1-file-upload-rce-via-filename-trailing-space"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109397", "GHSA-hjxm-gpw4-w4q7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.44, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2239f8ef-bfd1-3076-8c86-262531d53196", "product": {"name": "Thelia", "vendor": {"name": "Thelia"}}, "product_version": "3.2.0 <3.2.1"}, {"id": "34e5d82f-0d18-362e-a1e4-a33a2fb8ba63", "product": {"name": "Thelia", "vendor": {"name": "Thelia"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.1.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "19099e8a-3300-37ff-998d-7c95c99068c8", "vendor": {"name": "Thelia"}}], "isExploited": false}